uter quadrant  representative sections   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper central portion  including hemorrhagic  soft area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower central area  representative section   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper inner quadrant  including hemorrhagic area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower inner quadrant  representative sections  Received fresh  labeled  right breast   is a 19 x 16 x 5 5cm right simple mastectomy with a stitch marking the 12 o clock position  The anterior is inked blue and the posterior is inked black  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE areola with a 1 5cm in diameter unremarkable nipple  Sectioning reveals 4 firm nodular areas  Mass  1 measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm stellate white tan scar with central hemorrhagic discoloration with 2 adjacent clips  located in the upper inner quadrant near the 12 o clock position  10cm from the nipple  This mass abuts the anterior margin and is located 0 9cm from the posterior margin  Mass  2 is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm area of grittiness located posterior to the nipple  9cm from the anterior margin and 2cm from the posterior margin  Mass  3 is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm firm nodule located at the 11 o clock position  11cm from the nipple  abutting the anterior margin and located 5cm from the posterior margin  Mass  4 is a 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm firm  stellate  tan white mass located at the 10 o clock position  8cm from the nipple  This mass is located 0 5cm from the anterior margin and 4cm from the posterior margin  The remaining parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  No lymph nodes are identified in the axillary portion of the specimen  Gross photograph is taken  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1  approximately 75  submitted  with  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  representing mass  1 to the closest posterior margin  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  representing mass  1 to the anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2 to the posterior margin  entirely submitted   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  3  entirely submitted with  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  representing mass  3 to anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  4  entirely submitted  with  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  representing mass  4 to the closest anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower inner quadrant  representative section   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper outer quadrant  representative section  Received are 2 containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  Marrocco  REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh  labeled  left mastectomy skin   are 2 irregularly shaped pieces of skin  measuring 16 x 11 x 1 6cm and 16 x 8 x 2cm  The skin is tan brown  slightly wrinkled and unremarkable  Representative sections from each skin fragment are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right mastectomy skin   are 2 irregularly shaped fragments of tan brown  slightly wrinkled  unremarkable skin  measuring 15 x 11 x 1cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1cm  respectively  Representative sections from each fragment are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on Thursday May 07   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 12 17 35PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left   Simple Mastectomy PART B  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART C  Skin  Left Mastectomy   Excision PART D  Skin  Right Mastectomy   Excision  report_end  , Unchecked.
