 assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 15 30 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Left breast mass   are 2 fragments of breast tissue  The REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 0 3cm fragment is rubbery white  and has an overlying REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm skin ellipse  The REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm fragment has a 1 3cm ill defined white mass  A representative section of the mass is frozen as FX  1 and resubmitted in cassette A  and the remainder is in cassettes B and C  The smaller fragment is submitted entirely in cassette D  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS 1  LEFT BREAST   BIOPSY  INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA EXTENDING TO MARGINS  O R  Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  Jacqueline Haas  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
