 remaining breast parenchyma is unremarkable with no areas suspicious for invasive carcinoma  Section code  A  biopsy cavity in relation to inked deep resection margin B  biopsy cavity in relation to inked inferior resection margin C F  representative sections of biopsy cavity G  representative section of semi firm breast tissue from medial portion of breast H  representative section of prior surgical incision I  representative section of nipple Dissection of the REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm attached axillary tail reveals numerous soft tan to semi firm lymph nodes measuring from REMOVED_DATE to 2 5cm in greatest dimension  submitted in J M  Labeled  Level 1 node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm massive fatty tissue containing a single 1 0cm tan semi firm lymph node  bissected and submitted entirely in N  Resident  Douglas B  Flieder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  David L Berger  M D  PART A  LEVEL 1 NODE PART B  LEFT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
